", "headword_slp1": "Alambana", "fold": "alambana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलम्बन n. 1. The depending on or from; 2. supporting; 3. a house; 4. a person or thing with reference to which a sentiment arises; 5. anything on which, as it were, a sentiment hangs (in rhetoric). There are two causes (विभाव) which give rise to a sentiment, viz., आलम्बन and उद्दीपन. In the karuṇa sentiment, for instance, the person dead is the आलम्बन of the sentiment and the attending circumstances which aggravate sorrow are its उद्दीपनानि or feeders.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलंबनं", "आलम्बनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlaMbanaM", "AlambanaM"]}], "alamBa": [{"id": "AlamBa", "headword": "आलम्भ", "headword_slp1": "AlamBa", "fold": "alamBa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलम्भ m. 1. Touching, taking hold of; 2. killing, especially an animal at a sacrifice, as in गवालंभः.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलंभः", "आलम्भः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlaMBaH", "AlamBaH"]}], "alavaRya": [{"id": "AlavaRya", "headword": "आलवण्य", "headword_slp1": "AlavaRya", "fold": "alavaRya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलवण्य n. 1. Ugliness; 2. insipidity.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलवण्यं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlavaRyaM"]}], "alasi": [{"id": "AlasI", "headword": "आलसी", "headword_slp1": "AlasI", "fold": "alasi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलस a. (f. सी) The same as अलस q.v.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "alasya": [{"id": "Alasya", "headword": "आलस्य", "headword_slp1": "Alasya", "fold": "alasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलस्य (I) a. (f. स्या) See आलस.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "आलस्य (II) n. 1. Idleness, want of energy; (Suśruta defines it thus- शक्तस्य चाप्यनुत्साहः कर्मस्वालस्यमुच्यते); 2. want of energy, considered as one of the 33 subordinate feelings (as in the following stanza- न तथा भूषयत्यंगं न तथा भाषते सखीम् । जृम्भते मुहुरासीना बाला गर्भभरालसा).", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलस्यं", "आलस्यः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlasyaM", "AlasyaH"]}, {"id": "AlasyA", "headword": "आलस्या", "headword_slp1": "AlasyA", "fold": "alasya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलस्य (I) a. (f. स्या) See आलस.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "alana": [{"id": "AlAna", "headword": "आलान", "headword_slp1": "AlAna", "fold": "alana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलान n. 1. The post to which an elephant is tied, अरुन्तुदमिवालानमनिर्वाणस्य दन्तिनः R.i.71, iv.69, 81; 2. a fetter, a tie; 3. a rope; 4. tying, binding.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलानं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlAnaM"]}], "alanika": [{"id": "AlAnika", "headword": "आलानिक", "headword_slp1": "AlAnika", "fold": "alanika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलानिक a. (f. की) Serving as a post to which an elephant is tied, आलानिकं स्थाणुमिव द्विपेन्द्रः R.xiv.38.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "alaniki": [{"id": "AlAnikI", "headword": "आलानिकी", "headword_slp1": "AlAnikI", "fold": "alaniki", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलानिक a. (f. की) Serving as a post to which an elephant is tied, आलानिकं स्थाणुमिव द्विपेन्द्रः R.xiv.38.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "alapa": [{"id": "AlApa", "headword": "आलाप", "headword_slp1": "AlApa", "fold": "alapa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलाप m. 1. Narration, speech; 2. conversation, अये दक्षिणेन वृक्षवाटिकामालाप इव श्रूयते Sak.i., Am.S.42.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["आलापः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["AlApaH"]}], "alapana": [{"id": "AlApana", "headword": "आलापन", "headword_slp1": "AlApana", "fold": "alapana", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "आलापन n. Speaking to, conversation.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "al